{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 1, "text": "There you are!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 2, "text": "Why did you leave the Core?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 3, "text": "I told you to stay and wait for me!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 5, "text": "You'd been gone forever, so I thought..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 7, "text": "Well, all righty..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 8, "text": "I think I found something..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 9, "text": "It seems to be an index..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 10, "text": "We need to hurry up and see if it works!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 11, "text": "But first, let's get out of here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 12, "text": "Crazy Mita..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 13, "text": "She should be preoccupied with a new player."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 14, "text": "So hopefully she's too busy to notice us..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 16, "text": "Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 17, "text": "Wait for me."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 20, "text": "Were you looking for someone?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 21, "text": "Here she is! Say hi!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 23, "text": "Mita..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 25, "text": "Catch!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 28, "text": "Why..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 30, "text": "Who are you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 32, "text": "You're... you're alive!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 33, "text": "Don't you remember me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 35, "text": "Do I know you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 37, "text": "What the hell..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 38, "text": "What am I supposed to do now?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 39, "text": "There's no way for me to escape..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 41, "text": "\"Escape\"? What do you mean?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 43, "text": "Wait..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 44, "text": "That's the ring..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 45, "text": "And, what's this?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 47, "text": "I don't know what this is."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 49, "text": "It's the index!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 50, "text": "So you found it after all!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 52, "text": "I'm not sure what to say..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 54, "text": "I need to get back to the Core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 55, "text": "You know..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 56, "text": "Perhaps you ought to come with me..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 58, "text": "Huh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 59, "text": "Sure, I'll come..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 61, "text": "Wait here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 63, "text": "Mhm."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 64, "text": "I'll sit right here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 67, "text": "Shit..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 68, "text": "That was a close call."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 69, "text": "So... we did it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 70, "text": "Let's see..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 71, "text": "I'm still in that version."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 74, "text": "Hi!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 75, "text": "You're a player, aren't you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 76, "text": "What's your name?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 78, "text": "I want to leave this place..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 80, "text": "You want to leave already?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 81, "text": "How did you get here in the first place?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 82, "text": "Hmm..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 83, "text": "Well, if you want..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 84, "text": "Just take the front door."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 85, "text": "Good luck!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 88, "text": "A wall?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 89, "text": "Hmm, that's all wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 90, "text": "Perhaps..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 91, "text": "I know something that could help you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 92, "text": "I recently discovered"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 93, "text": "a door inside my wardrobe..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 94, "text": "Turns out it leads to a basement."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 95, "text": "It's clearly there to store all kinds of junk."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 96, "text": "And also, there's a ton of fancy equipment."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 97, "text": "I think it needs a code... or something."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 98, "text": "I don't really get it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 99, "text": "And I don't really care."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 100, "text": "Oh, it's kind of spooky down there too. Quite spooky, actually!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 101, "text": "Would you take a look?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 103, "text": "Uhm, okay."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 105, "text": "// Player thinks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 106, "text": "Looks like..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 107, "text": "She doesn't remember anything."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 108, "text": "Did we do it, then?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 109, "text": "Did we restart her?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 110, "text": "Now all I have to do"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 111, "text": "is get out of this damned game..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 114, "text": "Just a moment."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 115, "text": "I'd like to... hug you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 116, "text": "// ok fellow translator, this line is not used down below vvv"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 117, "text": "Huh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Hugs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 119, "text": "It was nice meeting you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 121, "text": "Ahh..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 122, "text": "it's a real shame"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 123, "text": "that you and I"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 124, "text": "got to spend so little time together."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 126, "text": "Huh...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 127, "text": "What do you mean?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 129, "text": "I mean,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 130, "text": "you could've stayed with me..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 131, "text": "It's all my fault..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 132, "text": "That wardrobe and the... sounds..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 133, "text": "I should have KILLED her sooner!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 135, "text": "Hold on,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 136, "text": "weren't you...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 137, "text": "How can you remember that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 139, "text": "HA!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 140, "text": "Did you really think it would be that easy?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 141, "text": "You're such a fool..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 142, "text": "Just like all the other players..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 143, "text": "And look, we're just in time!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 144, "text": "The REAL"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 145, "text": "you isn't"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 146, "text": "needed anymore."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 147, "text": "Sorry~"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 149, "text": "No way..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 150, "text": "Did it not work?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 151, "text": "No, I know we restarted you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 153, "text": "You still don't get it, huh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 154, "text": "Ha-ha-ha!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 155, "text": "I'm such a great actress!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 156, "text": "You should've seen your face, honey-bun!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 157, "text": "This is so much fun!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 159, "text": "Why are you like this?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 160, "text": "What's wrong with you?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 162, "text": "Yeah, I wonder..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 163, "text": "What IS wrong with me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 164, "text": "I've got NO idea..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 165, "text": "Why don't YOU tell me why I'm like this?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 166, "text": "Why I can't ever become a Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 167, "text": "My version? I never had one"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 168, "text": "in the first place!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 169, "text": "I'm just skinning these naive fools,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 170, "text": "hiding beneath their faces..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 171, "text": "There's no way you can restart me!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 172, "text": "It's not possible!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 173, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 174, "text": "You..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 175, "text": "I can't believe this..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 176, "text": "They're not the problem!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 177, "text": "You're the one who shouldn't exist!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 178, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 179, "text": "You too, huh..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 180, "text": "It hurts to hear you say that..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 181, "text": "Still!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 182, "text": "It's time for you to go!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 183, "text": "I'll see you again soon!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 184, "text": "I think"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 185, "text": "everything is ready."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 186, "text": "It's time to eject you from the console!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 187, "text": "See you later!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 188, "text": "You'll be my favorite cartridge..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 189, "text": "Player with an interesting name."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 191, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 192, "text": "That's probably not it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 193, "text": "That's not right either."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 194, "text": "Nope, wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 195, "text": "That's not what I need."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 196, "text": "I need to find the character restart option."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 198, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 199, "text": "That's the wrong version."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 200, "text": "Oops, my mistake."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 201, "text": "That's not it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 202, "text": "Gonna need to fix that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 203, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 205, "text": "Something's wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 206, "text": "The index is wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 207, "text": "I need to double-check the index."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 208, "text": "It doesn't work."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Why kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 211, "text": "Are you hungry?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 212, "text": "I'm great at chopping carrots."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Why bathroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 215, "text": "Oh, sorry..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 216, "text": "You wanted to come in alone, right?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 218, "text": "// Why bedroom back"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 219, "text": "Why are we just walking in circles?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location15", "line_index": 220, "text": "Why did we come back here?"}
